    {
      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how auto-captions find each word: how an app turns speech into text, and works out when each word was said. Our own videos depend on it. Every animation you see here is timed by it.",
